Update the existing Calculation module to implement the requirements below.

Reuse the existing application shell, shared components, navigation,
calculation identifiers, routing, services, backend integrations, and styling.

This is an enhancement of the existing implementation, not a redesign or
a separate application.

IMPORTANT:
- Preserve the existing Calculation module’s visual appearance.
- Initially show the calculation description and sector/scenario controls.
- After Calculate is clicked, open the execution container ABOVE the
  sector/scenario controls.
- Allow navigation between calculations while execution continues.
- Restore the last active run when users return to a calculation.
- Allow completed execution panels to be closed.
- Provide a clock icon for calculation history.

These requirements supersede earlier conflicting layout or styling instructions.

